OL,3,ARussia accuses Ukraine of attacking oil
OL,4,Arefinery after Zelensky says strikes to
OL,5,Aresume
OL,6,
OL,7,FRussian President Vladimir Putin said
OL,8,FKyiv had also tried to hit refineries
OL,9,Fon Wednesday - which Ukraine denied -
OL,10,Fbut there had been no "significant
OL,11,Fdamage".
OL,13,FZelensky also accused the US of
OL,14,Fwithdrawing intelligence-sharing to
OL,15,Fpressure Kyiv into ending attacks but
OL,16,FUkrainian defence sources later told
OL,17,Fthe BBC some functionality on Starlink
OL,18,Fsatellite services had resumed.
